          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu dahosheli kaprofwetu Yeremiya namwana kaNeriya Baruki hasonekeliyi mazu anu mumukanda chakukanwa kaYeremiya, mumwaka wamuchiwana waYehoyakimi, mwana kaYosiya, mwanta wawaYuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Eyi Baruki, Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela nahoshi naneyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Eyi wahosheli neyi, Iyayi lelu ami! Hayikatu yami Yehova nalunjikuhu yihuŋu; nazeya dehi nakwaba, hinamoni kunookaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wakamwila neyi, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiya, chinatuŋi nakachisanda, chinatumbi nakachibwita; kafwampi ituŋa dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Wudi nakukeŋakeŋa yuma yeyi yamaneni tahindi? Bayi wuyikeŋakeŋaku. Tiya, ami nakaleta katama hadi antu ejima. Ilaŋa wumi weyi nakakwinkawu wakekala neyi chuma chakupupa kunjita mwejima muwakaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
